Covered files ("the Artwork"):

- The Chord Notepad logo: resources/chord-notepad-icon.svg, and every image
  generated from it, including resources/icon-*.png,
  resources/chord-notepad-icon.ico, the Android launcher icons
  (android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_launcher*), and the icons in the
  Windows, MSIX, macOS, Flatpak and Snap packages.
- Store and promotional material in packaging/store/: screenshots, feature
  graphics and other images, and the store listing texts (listing-*.txt).

You may:

1. Copy and distribute the Artwork unmodified, as part of Chord Notepad
   itself, or of a version of it changed only as needed to build, package or
   install it for a particular operating system, distribution or app store,
   without changing what it does for its users.
2. Use the Artwork unmodified to build, run and test modified versions of
   Chord Notepad for yourself, as long as you don't distribute those versions
   with the Artwork.
3. Show the logo and the screenshots to refer to Chord Notepad, for example
   in reviews, articles, package listings, or a link to the project.

Anything else needs written permission from Tiberiu Chibici. In particular, a
modified version of Chord Notepad that you distribute must use its own name,
logo and icons (see term 3 of LICENSE.ADDITIONAL).
